  "description": {
    "en": "GAMMA TNT2 React Pro combines the patented TNT2 process with a proprietary low-friction coating and wear-resistant microfiber outer wraps. The reduced friction allows the main strings to slide and snap back more easily across the crosses, increasing ball bite and spin. Reinforced outer fibers help prevent notching and extend durability, while the TNT2 process preserves comfort, control and lively response.",

    "zh": "GAMMA TNT2 React Pro 将专利 TNT2 工艺与低摩擦表面涂层及耐磨微纤维外层结构结合。低摩擦设计让竖线能够更容易在横线上滑动并快速回位，从而提升 Snapback、咬球能力与旋转表现；强化耐磨纤维则可减少球线切槽磨损并提升耐久性。同时，TNT2 工艺继续保持良好的舒适性、控制能力和活跃的击球反馈。"
  },

